Title: finish_scan consults the Jitera deep-mode guard before persisting the final report
Why: deep scans self-declared "complete" and finished ~30% under budget with gaps still flagged unexamined; the guard (strix/jitera/persistence.py) refuses a premature deep finish, and checking before update_scan_final_fields means a held-back finish leaves no "completed" record behind
Upstream-PR: none

diff --git a/strix/tools/finish/tool.py b/strix/tools/finish/tool.py
index e3dcb7aee263e55c11ef9dfc3b5c54196a617205..f0b12b34a2bf04b3cd6eeec93cd934f78bd85875 100644
